# Printing an array renders its elements

Verifies an array renders as a bracketed, comma-separated list of its
elements, including an empty array and elements that keep their own subtypes.

>>> source
let empty: int[] = []
print(empty)
let sizes: int[] = [10mm, 2cm]
print(sizes)
let names: string[] = ["alice", "bob"]
print(names)

<<< stdout
[]
[10mm, 2cm]
[alice, bob]

<<< stderr
